WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.320
Right, match day.

00:01.320 --> 00:02.490
Start on Today.

00:02.490 --> 00:09.510
The votes card shows who is playing on Saturday: yes, maybe, no, and who has not answered.

00:10.010 --> 00:12.440
Just under it is the referee reminder.

00:12.440 --> 00:17.160
The league rule is you confirm with the appointed referee by the Wednesday

00:17.160 --> 00:18.180
before the game.

00:18.180 --> 00:20.550
Once you have, tap Referee confirmed.

00:20.550 --> 00:24.950
If you hear nothing, use the button to email the referees department.

00:25.460 --> 00:27.390
Now go to Match and tap the game.

00:27.890 --> 00:31.060
When the game was posted, families got a Playing?

00:31.060 --> 00:33.580
yes or no at the bottom of the message.

00:33.580 --> 00:39.070
Tap Pull in answers to bring their replies in, and it fills who is available for you.

00:39.570 --> 00:42.750
Before you pick, open Train, then Attendance.

00:42.750 --> 00:48.810
The team pick note shows who came to training, who did well and who watched the clips.

00:48.810 --> 00:52.900
It is a fair way to pick, and it all feeds into the stats.

00:53.400 --> 00:58.400
Back in the match, tap Suggest a starting eleven, or drag lads in yourself.

00:58.400 --> 01:00.740
Then print or share the team sheet.

01:01.240 --> 01:05.460
For the FA squad list, go to Team, then FA squad list.

01:05.460 --> 01:10.060
It shows the official FA PDF for Wigan Junior Latics Blues.

01:10.060 --> 01:16.310
You upload it once, and you only show it to the other manager on your own phone.

01:16.810 --> 01:21.550
If a fixture moves, open the game and tap Fixture change.

01:21.550 --> 01:24.780
Pick the new date or mark it postponed.

01:24.780 --> 01:29.600
Later games drop back a week and skip the Christmas break.

01:29.600 --> 01:36.830
Check the old and new dates, then save, and families get one alert and a fresh Playing?

01:36.830 --> 01:37.570
question.

01:37.570 --> 01:43.220
For a one off time or venue change, untick push later fixtures back.

01:43.720 --> 01:47.820
On the day, tap Go live for the clock, subs and goals.

01:47.820 --> 01:52.890
Afterwards, use Review to add the score and write the match report,

01:52.890 --> 01:55.090
then publish it for families.
